BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 418 Tm (Unit tests catch logic errors, integration tests catch interface issues, and) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 402 Tm (E2E tests validate complete user journeys. Together they provide layered) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 386 Tm (protection.) Tj ET
