BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 399 Tm (1. Order stable steps first) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 383 Tm (Put expensive but rarely changing steps early.) Tj ET
