BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 335 Tm (This minimizes cache invalidation.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 303 Tm (3. Use `.dockerignore`) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 287 Tm (Exclude files like `node_modules`, logs, and temporary files so unnecessary) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 271 Tm (changes do not break the cache.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 239 Tm (4. Use BuildKit cache mounts) Tj ET
BT /Courier 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 207 Tm (RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.npm npm ci) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 162 Tm (This persists package manager cache across builds.) Tj ET
